flowchart TD
    accTitle: Scopegate staged migration and compatible rollback
    accDescr: Local fixtures rehearse these phases. Real baseline, writers, consumers, approvals and monitored cohorts are required separately before live cutover.
    expand[Expand schema with Alembic<br/>Keep existing writer canonical]
    backfill[Resumable backfill<br/>Ledger and reviewed mapping]
    compare[Compare relationships and policy decisions]
    review{Equivalent or reviewed restriction?}
    quarantine[Quarantine ambiguity<br/>Correct mapping and replay batch]
    shadow[Shadow reads for selected organization<br/>Serve canonical existing decisions]
    fence[Fence organization legacy writes]
    delta[Apply final delta and verify revocations]
    cutover[Switch organization to canonical target]
    observe[Observe tenant pilot and audit]
    rollback[Target compatible application rollback<br/>Keep target schema and legacy write fence]
    contract[Contract after verified window<br/>Remove obsolete reads and schema]
    engine[Separate database engine change<br/>PostgreSQL 15 baseline to PostgreSQL 18<br/>Independent backup and restore rehearsal]

    expand --> backfill --> compare --> review
    review -->|No| quarantine --> backfill
    review -->|Yes| shadow --> fence --> delta --> cutover --> observe
    observe -->|Compatible application issue| rollback --> observe
    observe -->|All checks accepted| contract
    expand -.->|Independent change schedule| engine
    engine -.->|Independent recovery evidence| contract
